                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Winthrop to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic">September 20,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Winthrop reports the death on Friday, September 19, at 7.25 o’clock p.m., of
                    Her Majesty the Queen of Belgium.)</p>
